# line 6: "  config_path = " is 16 bytes.
GRT002 error live/app/terragrunt.hcl:6:17 live/app
# line 10: "  config_path  = " is 17 bytes.
GRT002 error live/app/terragrunt.hcl:10:18 live/app
# line 28: "  paths = [" is 11 bytes, "\"../target\", " is 13 more.
GRT002 error live/app/terragrunt.hcl:28:25 live/app
# line 28: "\"../gone_path\", " is 16 more: the "" entry is a self-loop.
GRT003 error live/app/terragrunt.hcl:28:41 live/app
